OL,3,GNEWSA'Blood on my pillow was the first
OL,4,Asign of leukaemia'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was diagnosed with
OL,7,Fleukaemia after waking up one morning
OL,8,Fwith blood on her pillow wants to raise
OL,9,Fawareness of the cancer.
OL,11,FDora Winslet, from Berkshire, was
OL,12,Fdiagnosed with acute myeloid leukaemia
OL,13,Fin 2021 after discovering the spot of
OL,14,Fblood where her ear had been whilst she
OL,15,Fslept.
OL,17,FFollowing years of treatment, the
OL,18,F61-year-old now wants to raise
OL,19,Fawareness of the disease and its
OL,20,Fsymptoms.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
