OL,3,GNEWSA'Blood on my pillow was the first
OL,4,Asign of leukaemia'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as the world marks blood
OL,7,Fcancer awareness month, with the
OL,8,Fresearch charity Leukaemia UK saying
OL,9,Fthat 33,000 people in the UK have blood
OL,10,Fcancer.
